{"id":331,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"全人教育と個性尊重で社会福祉に貢献する暁星","feature_description":"暁星学園は、全人教育と個性の尊重、宗教心と良心、ヒューマニストの育成、正義と平和、家庭的な校風を基本方針に掲げます。キリストの愛を教育の土台とし、人格の完成を目指すとともに、社会の福祉に貢献する人を育てます。一人ひとりの個性を大切にし、他者を尊重しながら学び、社会の中で責任を果たす姿勢を養います。基本方針を学園生活や教育活動に生かし、心の成長と社会への貢献をめざしています。","clubs":[{"id":14778,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14779,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14780,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14781,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14782,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14783,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14784,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14785,"name":"山岳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14786,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14787,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14788,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14789,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14790,"name":"化学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.gyosei-h.ed.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026